detaileddescription.para:
This function uses the following values of errno when an error state is reached: ENXIO - The given value is not within the range of V5 ports (1-21). ENODEV - The port cannot be configured as a vision sensor #defineAIVISION_PORT1
voidopcontrol(){
pros::AIVisionaivision(AIVISION_PORT);
char*class_name=newchar[20];
aivision.get_class_name(0,class_name);
printf("%s\n",class_name);
delete[]class_name;
}
